m/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/deployments","created_at":"2010-02-08T13:20:56Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T08:41:49Z","pushed_at":"2026-03-09T08:55:53Z","git_url":"git://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:elastic/elasticsearch.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch","homepage":"https://www.elastic.co/products/elasticsearch","size":1565901,"stargazers_count":76300,"watchers_count":76300,"language":"Java","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":25807,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":5588,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["elasticsearch","java","search-engine"],"visibility":"public","forks":25807,"open_issues":5588,"watchers":76300,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Background: We've always intended to share code between Logstash and Ingest Node, but we have never executed on this.\r\n\r\nIngest Node has 20+ processors, all of which are duplicated from Logstash in idea: append, convert, date, date index name, fail, grok, gsub, json, kv, lowercase, etc...\r\n\r\nThe reason I file this issue now is this ticket: https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/22547\r\n\r\nBy way of example, and as a modest proposal, the Logstash date filter is almost entirely written in Java, so to avoid future bugs like this (and have consistent behavior between Ingest Node and Logstash), I propose we reuse the date filter code. Similar for Grok and other things.\r\n\r\nAt this time, each same-feature in Ingest Node and Logstash may have different behavior, has different test suites, and the code is unshared. I believe this is a recipe for bad experience for users and maintenance headaches for us, and I believe we can fix it by enabling code sharing between the two components - Logstash and Ingest Node.\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\nPossible areas for conflict here:\r\n* Elasticsearch releases are released on different schedules than Logstash plugins are\r\n* Most (all?) code for Ingest Node is in the Elasticsearch repository. This not true for Logstash plugins.\r\n* The execution model between Ingest Node and Logstash are incompatible.\r\n\r\nThoughts?","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/22563/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/22563/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":921411269,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDkyMTQxMTI2OQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/events/921411269","actor":{"login":"talevy","id":388837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4ODgzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/388837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/talevy","html_url":"https://github.com/talevy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talevy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talevy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talevy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talevy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talevy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talevy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/use